6px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Management reasoning has evolved beyond traditional compensation as a means to increase employee engagement and productivity. Why? Because non-cash incentives, particularly travel, capture employee’s attention and create memorable experiences.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Budgeting</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Project Management &amp; Reporting</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Incentive Coordination</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Venue Sourcing</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span s